    // … other methods omitted
}

Join dummy = new DummyJoin();
System.out.println(isFullMasterWithOlderState.test(dummy)); // should print true
```

Feel free to adapt the code to your project’s package structure or to replace the `DummyJoin` with real instances coming from your cluster‑membership logic.

